[{"id":3758608948,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gB9I0","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/248124294?u=ce988cf3284fe34b1c5d241c02c1abf1445c74d5&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/mxtherfxcker","id":248124294,"node_id":"U_kgDODsoThg","login":"mxtherfxcker","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxtherfxcker"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115904#pullrequestreview-3758608948","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115904","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-02-05T18:02:26Z"},{"id":3759805200,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gGhMQ","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nI've double-checked that SSR roughness is still *mostly* resolution-independent. (It will still eventually decrease in roughness if the internal viewport resolution gets very low though.)\r\n\r\n### Scaling = 1.0, FSR2\r\n\r\n*Note that FSR2 applies its own mipmap LOD bias, similar to the **Texture Mipmap Bias** project setting. This bias affects screen-space reflections, which is probably a bug (similar to how it affects how reflection probes are sampled).*\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260205_233402\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ecd3a4b6-445e-435f-b9ab-c0948b5540f5\" /> | <img width=\"1919\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260205_233332\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4a29667-1598-4031-b02a-2cabdbb3e05f\" />\r\n\r\n### Scaling = 0.5, FSR2\r\n\r\n*Note that FSR2 applies its own mipmap LOD bias, which is more significant at `0.5` scaling compared to `1.0`.*\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260205_233407\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/051cc092-cc48-4d58-95c8-d0eb500c93b3\" /> | <img width=\"1919\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260205_233342\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc9b82c7-cf02-46f2-9cea-480f9d2183d4\" />\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115904#pullrequestreview-3759805200","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115904","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-05T22:37:07Z"},{"id":3759806101,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gGhaV","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115904#pullrequestreview-3759806101","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115904","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-05T22:37:28Z"},{"id":3778757698,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7hO0RC","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?u=6ecace2ddb6505607f21e3c41da42157298bd406&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","login":"blueskythlikesclouds","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds"},"body":"Makes sense to me. The derivatives for texture sampling with the maximum mipmap never really reach 0 so it makes sense to add the same guarantee here.\r\n\r\nYou should also add a comment explaining why like Calinou mentioned.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115904#pullrequestreview-3778757698","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115904","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-10T12:49:22Z"}]